      "Jambavan supported him, but added that determination must be accompanied by judgement. The party should conserve its strength, examine its surroundings carefully, and avoid unnecessary detours. Hanuman then suggested that the next stage of the journey should prioritise locating a reliable water source before the expedition continued farther.",
