      "While examining a rocky hillside, a group of Vanaras noticed an unusual opening between two great stone formations. It was wider than an ordinary animal shelter and descended into darkness. The surrounding ground was strangely quiet, and the air emerging from the entrance carried a coolness that seemed unexpected in the heat of the wilderness.",
