      "While the others rested, Swayamprabha spoke with Angada and Jambavan. She wanted to understand why their king had sent such a large expedition and what made the search so urgent. Angada explained that Rama had helped Sugriva regain his kingdom and that the Vanara king had promised to search for Sita in return.",
